1 loses balance to one side, knees bend;
2 lowers toward a controlled knee/hip fall;
3 seated side-fall with one palm bracing on ground, no pain or injury;
4 briefly curled side position, legs tucked but anatomically clear;
5 rolls upright to one knee;
6 plants one foot and pushes up;
7 rises through crouch;
8 returns upright with balanced feet and arms lowering;
9 stable ready stance. Make this a continuous valid human action, not a crawling/prone pose in normal play. One deliberate low frame only; never distort, flatten or merge limbs.

All ten distinct full bodies; same scale and identity, no clipped limbs/hair. No ball or props. Transparent alpha-zero background/gutters, no haze/checkerboard. Crisp 1990s arcade pixel clusters. Return only the sheet.
